# Real ballot-level preference data for the MapLibre Governing Board Election 2025 (6
# candidates, 5 seats, 92 ballots cast, 89 valid + 3 empty) -- a real Meek STV election run by
# a real open-source governance body via OpaVote. Downloaded from MapLibre's own results
# mirror at https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre/blob/main/2025-polls/MapLibre-Governing-Board-Election-Ballots.txt
# (linked from https://maplibre.org/news/2025-09-22-board-elections-2025/, "Checkout the
# detailed election results on GitHub"). OpaVote's own live results page
# (https://www.opavote.com/results/5696407649386496, cited by that same post) has since gone
# offline, but MapLibre also mirrored the results PDF alongside this ballot file
# (MapLibre-Governing-Board-Election-Results.pdf, same directory) -- see
# MeekMapLibreGoverningBoard2025FixtureTest for what that PDF publishes (winners, and every
# round's keep factors to 6 decimal places) and how closely this project's MeekCounter
# reproduces it from these ballots alone.
